  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GCE GRANT ROUND 2025 TOOLS FOR SOLIDARITY</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Workshops will be delivered on ESD to schools, HE, youth and adult community groups, building on previous projects funded by Irish Aid. The goal is that participants are made aware of the interdependent and unequal world in which we live, and are empowered to implement change. Workshops cover topics such as inequality, climate change, poverty and fair-trade. An annual sustainability event will be held to enable adult workshop participants to translate their learning into practical action.</narrative>
  </description>
